      "value": "@{62df7cd83e007e467295c4e1|full_name} the law says accredited id service under the Digital ID Act 2024. its under section 63DB 1 B\n\nhttps://classic.austlii.edu.au/au/legis/cth/num_act/osammaa2024409/sch1.html\n\nalso i forgot to say in the original post what they mean by material. here is the def of class 1 and class 2 material as per the online safety act 2021\n\nhttps://classic.austlii.edu.au/au/legis/cth/consol_act/osa2021154/s106.html\n\nhttps://classic.austlii.edu.au/au/legis/cth/consol_act/osa2021154/s107.html\n\nthe new laws are an amendment to the online safety act 2021",
