  "details": "what is going to be done about the under 16 ban in australia thats going into effect on December 10th. from my understanding its going to affect anything that allows for communication over the internet.\n\nlike is it going to be inforced id checking or is there going to be another check put in place?\n\ni would grab the law and throw it here but i think the esafety commissions page will do\n\nhttps://www.esafety.gov.au/about-us/industry-regulation/social-media-age-restrictions\n\nedit: the reason for this is the fine is 30000 penalty units/Offense. I've also checks the laws and it will require a digital id check",
